At the current pace of 6 lane-miles a week, the program reaches about 110 lane-miles by 2026-11-30, leaving about 10 for spring 2027.

## Districts

data districts = district,planned,done,status; North,28,22,Green; Central,24,21,Green; East,26,15,Amber; South,22,11,Amber; West,20,5,Red

table districts bar=done target=planned title="Lane-miles done against planned"

!! West is red. A water main replacement blocks 8 lane-miles until 2026-11-02, and the contractor's second paving crew is committed elsewhere until 2026-11-09.

## Decision needed

The council chooses how to handle the West district.

cards

### Pay for an extra crew

$180,000 for an extra crew in the West district.

### Carry into spring

Carry the leftover miles into spring 2027.

